    <comment>Thu Aug 20 13:53:41 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal &lt;mpluskal@suse.com&gt;

- Ship shared common/ fragments in the -devel package
  (define-grammar.js, scanner.h, common.mak) next to php/ and
  php_only/, so grammar.js require('../common/...') resolves
  and installcheck no longer demands
  treesitter_grammar_src(../common).</comment>
